344807,"en":"Who are you kidding?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l018","ordinal":344808,"en":"You speak the truth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l019","ordinal":344809,"en":"If you are rich, touch the slave -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l020","ordinal":344810,"en":"You are perfect."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l021","ordinal":344811,"en":"You left my mother!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l022","ordinal":344812,"en":"I will not be grateful to you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l023","ordinal":344813,"en":"Sarybay, son of a monster"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l024","ordinal":344814,"en":"I will not compete with you."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l025","ordinal":344815,"en":"I don't understand what you say"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l026","ordinal":344816,"en":"From the raging fire"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l027","ordinal":344817,"en":"I will not separate!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l028","ordinal":344818,"en":"Not finding a man in a certain place,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l029","ordinal":344819,"en":"Looking forward to find the best place,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l030","ordinal":344820,"en":"Sometimes I can't find a mountain to run to,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l031","ordinal":344821,"en":"Not finding anything to do,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l032","ordinal":344822,"en":"The son of a monster is an infidel"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l033","ordinal":344823,"en":"How do I pay?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l034","ordinal":344824,"en":"It was a branch without a husband - he said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l035","ordinal":344825,"en":"How can I go to my people!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l036","ordinal":344826,"en":"Akun's daughter Aychurek"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l037","ordinal":344827,"en":"Who will listen to this talk of yours,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l038","ordinal":344828,"en":"Let the ordinary black sur listen,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l039","ordinal":344829,"en":"Let the night hear without day,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b002:l040","ordinal":344830,"en":"Let the ignorant listen to this!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b003:l001","ordinal":344831,"en":"If you shoot blindly, the bullet will not penetrate."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0653:b003:l002","ordinal":344832,"en":"The collar is gold, the sleeves are brass,"}]
